WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.612
Imagine if you were to have an 
intelligent&nbsp;sheet that can self-fold

00:00:04.612 --> 00:00:07.273
into any form it wants, anytime.

00:00:07.273 --> 00:00:09.521
And that's what I've been&nbsp;working on.

00:00:09.521 --> 00:00:12.552
And I call this robotic origami,

00:00:12.552 --> 00:00:13.847
"robogami."

00:00:13.847 --> 00:00:19.436
Ten years later, with my group of&nbsp;
ninja origami robotic researchers --

00:00:19.436 --> 00:00:22.522
we have a new generation of robogamis.

00:00:22.522 --> 00:00:26.681
This&nbsp;one actually navigates through 
different terrains autonomously.

00:00:26.681 --> 00:00:29.590
So when it's a dry and flat land,&nbsp;it crawls.

00:00:29.590 --> 00:00:32.870
And if it meets sudden rough 
terrain, it starts rolling.

00:00:32.870 --> 00:00:37.166
It's the same&nbsp;robot -- but depending 
on which terrain it meets,

00:00:37.166 --> 00:00:41.770
it activates a different sequence
 of actuators&nbsp;that's on board.

00:00:41.770 --> 00:00:44.610
And once it meets an obstacle, 
it jumps over it.

00:00:44.610 --> 00:00:48.999
It does this by&nbsp;storing energy in 
each of its legs and releasing it

00:00:48.999 --> 00:00:51.171
and catapulting&nbsp;like a slingshot.

00:00:51.171 --> 00:00:55.196
For robogamis, there's no 
one fixed shape nor task.

00:00:55.196 --> 00:00:59.601
They can&nbsp;transform into 
anything, anywhere, anytime.

